# Run outputs derived from InteriorGS stay out of git (policy and the user's answer, 2026-11-24: hear-lab/data/README.md).
# Everything is ignored except the files listed below. Folders are un-ignored so git can reach the listed files.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
# sha256 manifests of the two copies
!timing/copy_manifest.sha256
!main/copy_manifest_main.sha256
# summaries and per-episode results (scores, distances, episode ids)
!main/runs/main/summary.json
!main/runs/main/rung1_episodes.jsonl
!timing/runs/timing-r2/summary.json
!timing/runs/timing-r2/rung1_episodes.jsonl
